## PHASE 5 — Validator

**Context to attach:** `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `.github/skills/nexus-agent/references/skill-contract.md`
**Mode:** Edit.

````text
PROMPT — PHASE 5

Create one file: `.github/skills/nexus-agent/hooks/validate-registry.ps1`

Windows PowerShell 5.1. Pure validation plus one generated artifact. It must never
clone, install, or modify any file except the generated JSON.

Parameters:
  -WorkspaceRoot [string] Optional, defaults to repo root from $PSScriptRoot.
  -Fix           [switch] Regenerate the JSON mirror instead of only reporting drift.

Checks, each reporting PASS or FAIL with the offending value:

C1  copilot-instructions.md exists and both required tables parse.
C2  Every Capability token is unique and matches ^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$.
C3  Every Agent referenced in Routes exists in Agent Registry.
