C5  Every active agent's Repo org is in the allowlist (read the $AllowedOrgs list
    from install-skill.ps1 so the two cannot drift).
C6  Every Routes row has at least two Example Phrasings.
C7  For each INSTALLED skill folder under .github/skills/ that contains a SKILL.md:
      - frontmatter parses and schemaVersion is 1
      - name matches the folder name
      - every capability listed appears in the Routes table
      - all five required body H2s are present
      - file is 200 lines or fewer
      - every allowedCommands.exec is an array, not a string
      Skip folders with no SKILL.md — those are not yet installed and are not errors.
C8  Every `requires` entry names an agent that exists in the Agent Registry.
