    `.github/prompts/nexus-install-<agent>.prompt.md`, and no such prompt file
    exists for an agent absent from the Registry. With -Fix, delegate regeneration
    to generate-install-prompts.ps1 if that script exists; otherwise report only.

Output: one line per check, `[PASS]` / `[FAIL]` / `[FIXED]` prefixed. Then a summary
count. Exit 0 if no FAIL, exit 1 otherwise, so it can gate a pull request.

