## AFTER THE BUILD

- Add `validate-registry.ps1` to your PR check. It is the entire CI story at IDE scope.
- Adding an agent is now: two rows in `copilot-instructions.md`, then `validate-registry.ps1 -Fix`. No code change, no new agent file.
- If you later need this to run headless in CI, the only file that must change is `nexus-agent.agent.md`. Everything else — registry, contract, installer, validator — is already vendor-neutral. Keep it that way.
